INCLUDED_SVDPI defined and a second include changes nothing 1
DPI_EXTERN undefined after the header 1
DPI_PROTOTYPES XXTERN EETERN undefined after the header 1
uint8_t and uint32_t available with sizes 1 and 4 1
sv_0 sv_1 sv_z sv_x are 0 1 2 3 1
svScalar is uint8_t 1
svBit and svLogic are svScalar 1
svBitVecVal is uint32_t 1
VPI_VECVAL defined 1
t_vpi_vecval aliases s_vpi_vecval p_vpi_vecval 1
t_vpi_vecval aval bval uint32_t in this order 1
svLogicVecVal is s_vpi_vecval 1
SV_PACKED_DATA_NELEMS of 1 32 33 64 65 is 1 1 2 2 3 1
SV_GET_UNSIGNED_BITS of 0xabcd1234 with 32 8 1 is 0xabcd1234 0x34 0x0 1
VPI_TIME defined 1
t_vpi_time aliases s_vpi_time p_vpi_time 1
t_vpi_time type int32_t high low uint32_t real double in this order 1
vpiScaledRealTime vpiSimTime vpiSuppressTime are 1 2 3 1
svTimeVal is s_vpi_time 1
sv_scaled_real_time sv_sim_time are vpiScaledRealTime vpiSimTime 1
